#
# A row of Tintype's rights register (tintype_rules.h TR3), in Sutra: a
# fixed business record of the photo's number, its owner's number, the
# licence code it is offered under (0 all rights reserved, 1 public
# domain dedication, 2 attribution, 3 attribution share-alike, 4
# attribution no derivatives, 5 attribution non-commercial, 6
# non-commercial share-alike, 7 non-commercial no derivatives) and the
# release flag (1 when a signed release from the people shown is on
# file). The photo and owner fit 9(9), the code 9(2) and the flag 9(1):
# a negative value, or one with more digits, is a size error, refused.
record rights-row
  photo: 9(9)
  owner: 9(9)
  licence: 9(2)
  release: 9(1)
procedure
  answer photo >= 1 and owner >= 1 and licence <= 7 and release <= 1
